# Replay

The package contains all numerical/scientific producer scripts used in this HDIM campaign and copies of the minimal predecessor inputs.

Run:

```bash
PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 replay.py --check
python3 verify_package.py
```

`replay.py --check` regenerates all result JSON files in dependency-safe filename order and compares their SHA-256 hashes with `EXPECTED_RESULTS.sha256`.
